---
name: "About"
title: "Genetic diagnostics company in Hyderabad | Lightening Lives"
description: "Lightening Lives LLP develops REASSURED genetic tests. Founded by Dr. Giriraj Ratan Chandak, formerly Chief Scientist at CSIR-CCMB. ICMR approved."
label: About
h1: 'The scientists and the team <span class="h-mark">behind the tests.</span>'
lead: "Lightening Lives is a Hyderabad healthcare technology company. We develop REASSURED genetic tests so inherited disorders are found early, confirmed once and cared for."
closing:
  h2: 'Work with us. <span class="h-mark">Most of our work begins as a collaboration.</span>'
  body: "Tell us the condition you need to test for and where the testing will happen."
  solid: { text: "Partner with us", href: "/partners/" }
  line: { text: "Contact us", href: "/contact/" }
---
{#- About (content file 5.8), people first since 25 October 2026 (the user: "people feel secondary";
    less text; bios open on a click). The founders in a spotlight; the team in its groups, then the
    patron and the advisers, each a portrait card; the company at a glance, lower and compact. A bio
    is never on the page itself: a card with one opens it in a side panel, a native popover (the
    browser opens and closes it, no script; Escape or a click outside closes it). A person without an
    approved bio has a card that does not open. Each card keeps its person's slug as its anchor, which
    the old team addresses forward to. -#}
{%- from "picture.njk" import picture with context %}
{%- set ff = team.founders[0] %}
{%- set co = team.founders[1] %}

{#- A person's bio in its side panel. -#}
{%- macro bioPanel(p, photo) -%}
<div class="bio-panel" id="bio-{{ p.slug }}" popover role="dialog" aria-labelledby="bio-{{ p.slug }}-h">
  <button type="button" class="bio-close" popovertarget="bio-{{ p.slug }}" popovertargetaction="hide" aria-label="Close">{% icon "x" %}</button>
  {{ picture(photo or ("person-" + p.slug), p.name, "24rem", { class: "bio-photo" }) }}
  <div class="bio-body">
    <h3 id="bio-{{ p.slug }}-h" class="bio-name">{{ p.name }}{% if p.credentials %} <span>{{ p.credentials }}</span>{% endif %}</h3>
    <p class="bio-role">{{ p.role }}</p>
    {%- for para in p.bio | paragraphs %}
    <p>{{ para }}</p>
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>
</div>
{%- endmacro %}

{#- A portrait card: the whole card opens the bio where there is one. -#}
{%- macro card(p, group) -%}
<li id="{{ p.slug }}" class="tcard">
  {%- if p.bio %}
  <button type="button" class="tcard-face" popovertarget="bio-{{ p.slug }}">
    {{ picture("person-" + p.slug, p.name, "(min-width: 72rem) 17rem, (min-width: 40rem) 30vw, 46vw", { class: "tcard-photo" }) }}
    <span class="tcard-text">
      <span class="tcard-name">{{ p.name }}</span>
      <span class="tcard-role">{{ p.role }}</span>
    </span>
    <span class="tcard-open" aria-hidden="true">{% icon "plus" %}</span>
  </button>
  {{- bioPanel(p) }}
  {%- else %}
  <div class="tcard-face">
    {{ picture("person-" + p.slug, p.name, "(min-width: 72rem) 17rem, (min-width: 40rem) 30vw, 46vw", { class: "tcard-photo" }) }}
    <span class="tcard-text">
      <span class="tcard-name">{{ p.name }}</span>
      <span class="tcard-role">{{ group if p.role == "Adviser" else p.role }}</span>
    </span>
  </div>
  {%- endif %}
</li>
{%- endmacro %}

  <!-- The founders, in a spotlight -->
  <section id="founder" class="section on-mist founder-band" aria-labelledby="founder-h">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="spotlight" id="founders">
        <div class="spotlight-photo">
          {{ picture("person-founders", "Dr. Giriraj Ratan Chandak and Mrs. Nidhi Chandak", "(min-width: 64rem) 34rem, 92vw") }}
        </div>
        <div class="spotlight-body">
          <p class="spotlight-kind">The founders</p>
          <h2 id="founder-h" class="spotlight-name"><span id="{{ ff.slug }}">{{ ff.name }}</span></h2>
          <p class="spotlight-role">{{ ff.role }} <span>· {{ ff.credentials }}</span></p>
          <ul class="spotlight-record">
            <li>{% icon "landmark" %}<span><b>Former Chief Scientist</b>CSIR-CCMB, Hyderabad</span></li>
            <li>{% icon "graduation-cap" %}<span><b>Former Director</b>CDFD, founding faculty</span></li>
            <li>{% icon "award" %}<span><b>Sir J.C. Bose Fellow</b>Government of India</span></li>
            <li>{% icon "users" %}<span><b>Fellow</b>all four Indian science academies and TWAS</span></li>
          </ul>
          <p class="spotlight-line">Twenty-five years on inherited disorders, from the laboratory to the communities that most needed testing.</p>
          <div class="spotlight-act">
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-solid" popovertarget="bio-{{ ff.slug }}">His story</button>
            <button type="button" class="spotlight-co" popovertarget="bio-{{ co.slug }}" id="{{ co.slug }}">
              <span><b>{{ co.name }}</b>{{ co.role }}</span>{% icon "arrow-right" %}
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      {{- bioPanel(ff, "person-founders") }}
      {{- bioPanel(co, "person-founders") }}
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- The people: the team in its groups, then the patron and the advisers -->
  <section id="team" class="section bg-paper" aria-labelledby="team-h">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:items-start">
        <h2 id="team-h" class="h2 lg:col-span-7">The team. <span class="h-mark">Tap anyone to meet them.</span></h2>
        <p class="lead lg:col-span-5">Scientists, laboratory specialists and operations staff, guided by a patron and an advisory board.</p>
      </div>
      {%- for g in team.groups %}
      <div class="tgroup">
        <h3 class="tgroup-h">{% icon g.icon %}{{ g.name }}</h3>
        <ul class="tgrid">
          {%- for p in team.team %}{% if p.group == g.id %}{{ card(p) }}{% endif %}{% endfor %}
        </ul>
      </div>
      {%- endfor %}
      <div class="tgroup">
        <h3 class="tgroup-h">{% icon "compass" %}Patron and advisers</h3>
        <ul class="tgrid">
          {%- for p in team.patron %}{{ card(p, "Patron") }}{% endfor %}
          {%- for p in team.advisers %}{{ card(p, "Advisory board") }}{% endfor %}
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- The company at a glance -->
  <section id="facts" class="section" aria-labelledby="facts-h">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2 id="facts-h" class="h2 max-w-[44rem]">At a <span class="h-mark">glance.</span></h2>
      <dl class="facts-grid mt-10">
        {%- for row in [
          { icon: "building-2", term: "Legal name", def: site.legalName },
          { icon: "map-pin", term: "Headquarters", def: "Hyderabad, Telangana, India" },
          { icon: "user-round", term: "Founder and CEO", def: "Dr. Giriraj Ratan Chandak" },
          { icon: "dna", term: "What we do", def: "Develop REASSURED genetic tests for inherited disorders" },
          { icon: "package", term: "Tests", def: "LitLife™-SCA, -SiBThal217, -BThal, -AlphaThal and -SMA; HbD and HbE testing" },
          { icon: "hourglass", term: "In development", def: "A blood coagulation panel; pharmacogenomics" },
          { icon: "badge-check", term: "Approvals", def: "LitLife™-SCA, ICMR approved" },
          { icon: "award", term: "Patents", def: "Granted in India and Japan; published internationally" }
        ] %}
        <div>
          <dt>{% icon row.icon %}<span>{{ row.term }}</span></dt>
          <dd>{{ row.def }}</dd>
        </div>
        {%- endfor %}
      </dl>
    </div>
  </section>
